# Drafts are local-only: this repo is PUBLIC and master auto-deploys, so anything
# committed here ships. Enforced here rather than left to the habit of never
# running `git add -A`.
#
# `drafts/*` and not `drafts/` on purpose: git does not descend into a directory
# it has excluded outright, which would make the two negations below dead lines.
# Those two are already tracked, already deployed and answer HTTP 200 - they are
# deliberate unguessable preview URLs, not leaks, so they stay shippable.
drafts/*
!drafts/r510-r550-guide-e7k2m9qw4z/
!drafts/water-effects-x7q2m4vk/
api/form-relay.log
